Patches to Wasmer 7.3.0 for the ServiceCache host process.

scripts/setup-wasmer applies the series to a checkout under work/wasmer, and
the workspace builds the host against the Wasmer crates from that tree. The
series is developed as commits on a branch of that checkout and written back
with scripts/export-wasmer-patches. It is maintained for the sys backend on
Linux.

